DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H0_0::
	.string "I'm BRAWLY!\n"
	.string "DEWFORD's GYM LEADER!\p"
	.string "I've been churned in the rough waves\n"
	.string "of these parts, and I've grown tough\l"
	.string "in the pitch-black cave!\p"
	.string "So you wanted to challenge me?\n"
	.string "Let me see what you're made of!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H0_1::
	.string "Whoah, wow! You made a much bigger\n"
	.string "splash than I expected!\p"
	.string "You swamped me!\p"
	.string "Okay, you've got me.\n"
	.string "Take this GYM BADGE!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H0_2::
	.string "I can see your talent becoming a\n"
	.string "giant wave to cause a storm of\l"
	.string "astonishment among TRAINERS one\l"
	.string "day!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H1_0::
	.string "Might is right!\n"
	.string "Come on!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H1_1::
	.string "Not enough power…$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H1_2::
	.string "Your skill overcame my strength!\n"
	.string "Your technique is commendable!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H2_0::
	.string "There's no need for BRAWLY to be\n"
	.string "involved!\p"
	.string "I'll crush you!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H2_1::
	.string "But… How?\n"
	.string "How could I lose so easily?$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H2_2::
	.string "I'm not going to waste this loss.\n"
	.string "I'll use it to motivate me to train!\p"
	.string "One day I'll become a GYM LEADER…\p"
	.string "No, I'll become the POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
	.string "CHAMPION!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H3_0::
	.string "Don't you dare brush me off!\n"
	.string "It's not my fault if you cry!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H3_1::
	.string "Waaaaaaah!\n"
	.string "I lost!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H3_2::
	.string "I battle in the dark to make my\n"
	.string "heart stronger.\p"
	.string "But because it's so dark, I can\n"
	.string "never see BRAWLY's face…$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H4::
	.string "Hey, how's it going, CHAMPION-\n"
	.string "bound {PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "DEWFORD's GYM LEADER BRAWLY\n"
	.string "commands FIGHTING-type POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Going against him with NORMAL-type\n"
	.string "POKéMON is asking for trouble.\p"
	.string "FIGHTING POKéMON will lay a serious\n"
	.string "smack down on NORMAL POKéMON,\l"
	.string "so be careful!\p"
	.string "What's worse, the GYM is as dark as\n"
	.string "the ocean floor.\p"
	.string "But it will get brighter after\n"
	.string "defeating the TRAINERS in your way.\p"
	.string "Hey, okay, go for it!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H5_0::
	.string "If you mean to pass, it has to be\n"
	.string "through me!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H5_1::
	.string "Grrrrr!\n"
	.string "Vastly overpowered!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H5_2::
	.string "You win!\n"
	.string "Go after that BADGE!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H6_0::
	.string "Ufufu… Are you stumbling around in\n"
	.string "the dark?$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H6_1::
	.string "Oh, you…\n"
	.string "I don't want to know you!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H6_2::
	.string "You deserve to stay lost and end up\n"
	.string "back at the entrance again!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H7_0::
	.string "I'll show you the gumption of\n"
	.string "a sailing man!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H7_1::
	.string "How'd this happen?\n"
	.string "It's not like me to lose this way!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_H7_2::
	.string "Oh, aye! You're worthy of seeing\n"
	.string "our GYM LEADER.$"

@ BEGIN PATCH (tools/hoenn_import/patches)
DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyIntro::
    .string "You're the one off the KANTO\n"
    .string "plane. Word gets around a town\l"
    .string "this size in about an hour.\p"
    .string "I train where the waves come in\n"
    .string "hardest. You can't argue with the\l"
    .string "sea, so you learn to take it.\p"
    .string "Let's see what KANTO taught you.$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyDefeat::
    .string "Hah! You read the water better\n"
    .string "than I did.\p"
    .string "Take the KNUCKLE BADGE. It's\n"
    .string "HOENN's, and it's the first one\l"
    .string "you've earned here.\p"
    .string "{FONT_NORMAL}{PLAYER} received the KNUCKLE BADGE\n"
    .string "from BRAWLY!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}\p"
    .string "{FONT_MALE}It won't make your POKéMON any\n"
    .string "stronger the way KANTO's do. Here\l"
    .string "it only says where you've been.\p"
    .string "The man with the register at\n"
    .string "SLATEPORT's harbor keeps count\l"
    .string "of them. Go and tell him.$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_TakeThisTM::
    .string "And take this with you.$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM08::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM08 from\n"
    .string "BRAWLY!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_ExplainTM08::
    .string "TM08 is BULK UP. It tightens\n"
    .string "everything up at once: ATTACK and\l"
    .string "DEFENSE both.\p"
    .string "Useful when you've decided to stop\n"
    .string "dodging.$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_NoRoomForTM08::
    .string "Your BAG's full. Come back with\n"
    .string "room in it.$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyPostBattle::
    .string "The sea's the same today as it was\n"
    .string "when you beat me. That's the good\l"
    .string "thing about it.$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyPikachu::
    .string "That PIKACHU of yours.\p"
    .string "No electric type has walked into\n"
    .string "this gym in my time. Salt water\l"
    .string "and sparks don't mix, they say.\p"
    .string "It doesn't seem to mind the spray\n"
    .string "at all, does it.$"
@ END PATCH
